{#-
  The home-value email: what a person gets after asking a lead page what their
  home is worth. Design's 5th package (emails/home-value/home-value-ready.html),
  with the departures below. Rendered by `worker.email.home_value`.

  AUTOESCAPED, UNLIKE THE MARKET BLOCKS. Every value here is plain text from
  the database or the person who filled in the form — their own name included —
  and nothing passed in is markup. So the environment escapes, and no caller
  escapes first.

  NO ESTIMATE (owner decision, 2026-10-28). Design's value panel is gone. The
  number stays in the report, beside the comparable sales it comes from; alone
  in an email it reads like an appraisal. Nor is there a range, a confidence,
  or a comp count in this email: each is a piece of the same number.

  WHAT ELSE IS NOT DESIGN'S, AND WHY
    "It's a PDF" / "PDF · 6 pages · 2.1 MB"  the link opens a web page (/r/{id}).
    The report-cover thumbnail             no cover image exists for this report.
    "What's inside"                         rewritten to the viewer's real tabs:
                                            Details, Comps, Market. Design's "what
                                            we corrected" is not something it does.
    The agent's first-person note          the agent did not write it; replaced
                                            with a plain line naming who to ask.
    "nothing else will come"               an agent can add a lead to a list later;
                                            the email says only what is true now.
    Call / Text buttons                    `tr-ink` + `tr-rule`, which Design's lack:
                                            1.22:1 in dark mode in the review.
-#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<title>Your home value report — {{ brand_name }}</title>
<!--[if mso]><noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript><![endif]-->
<style>
  body{margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;}
  table{mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0;}
  img{border:0;line-height:100%;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){
    .tr-page{background:#111827 !important;}
    .tr-card{background:#1F2937 !important;border-color:#374151 !important;}
    .tr-ink{color:#F3F4F6 !important;}
    .tr-body{color:#D1D5DB !important;}
    .tr-muted{color:#9CA3AF !important;}
    .tr-rule{border-color:#374151 !important;}
    .tr-brand{color:{{ dark_ink }} !important;}
  }
  @media only screen and (max-width:620px){
    .tr-wrap{width:100% !important;}
    .tr-pad{padding-left:20px !important;padding-right:20px !important;}
    .tr-hide{display:none !important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body class="tr-page" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FAFAF7;">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">{{ preheader }}&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;</div>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="tr-page" style="background:#FAFAF7;border-collapse:collapse;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" class="tr-wrap tr-card" style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #E4E2DA;">
  <tr><td bgcolor="{{ primary }}" style="background:{{ primary }};font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
    <td class="tr-pad" style="padding:18px 28px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">{% if logo_url %}<img src="{{ logo_url }}" alt="{{ brand_name }}" style="display:block;max-width:160px;max-height:32px;width:auto;height:auto;border:0;">{% else %}<span style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:{{ on_primary }};">{{ brand_name }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    <td align="right" class="tr-pad tr-hide" style="padding:18px 28px;text-align:right;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12.5px;color:{{ on_primary }};">{{ date_label }}</span></td>
  </tr></table></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:26px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><span class="tr-muted" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748B;">Home value report · {{ address_line }}</span></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:10px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
    <h1 class="tr-ink" style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#0F172A;">{% if first_name %}{{ first_name }}, your report is ready.{% else %}Your report is ready.{% endif %}</h1>
    <p class="tr-body" style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#334155;">You asked what {{ address }} is worth today. Your report has the nearby sales that answer it, what they suggest, and how your local market is moving. It opens in your browser.</p>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td align="center" class="tr-pad" style="padding:28px 28px 8px;text-align:center;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="border-collapse:separate;"><tr><td bgcolor="{{ primary }}" style="background:{{ primary }};border-radius:10px;"><a href="{{ report_url }}" style="display:block;padding:15px 30px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:{{ on_primary }};text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;">Open your report</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:26px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
    <div class="tr-muted" style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#64748B;">What’s inside</div>
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
      {%- for title, line in inside %}
      <tr><td class="tr-rule" style="padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ECEAE3;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><span class="tr-ink" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;">{{ title }}</span><span class="tr-muted" style="font-size:14px;color:#64748B;"> — {{ line }}</span></td></tr>
      {%- endfor %}
    </table>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:28px 28px 24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
    <td width="56" valign="top" style="width:56px;">{% if photo_url %}<img src="{{ photo_url }}" alt="{{ agent_name }}" width="56" height="56" style="display:block;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:28px;border:0;">{% else %}<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="56" height="56" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="{{ primary }}" style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:28px;background:{{ primary }};font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:{{ on_primary }};">{{ initials }}</td></tr></table>{% endif %}</td>
    <td valign="top" style="padding-left:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
      <div class="tr-ink" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;">{{ agent_name }}</div>
      {% if title_line %}<div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;">{{ title_line }}</div>{% endif %}
      <p class="tr-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#334155;">Questions about your report? {{ agent_first }} can walk you through it.</p>
      {% if buttons %}<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:separate;margin-top:14px;"><tr>{% for href, label in buttons %}{% if not loop.first %}<td width="10" style="width:10px;"></td>{% endif %}<td class="tr-rule" style="border:1px solid #E4E2DA;border-radius:10px;"><a href="{{ href }}" class="tr-ink" style="display:block;padding:10px 18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;text-decoration:none;">{{ label }}</a></td>{% endfor %}</tr></table>{% endif %}
      {% if phone and not phone_href %}<div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;">{{ phone }}</div>{% endif %}
    </td>
  </tr></table></td></tr>
  <tr><td class="tr-pad tr-rule" style="padding:20px 28px 28px;border-top:1px solid #ECEAE3;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
    <p class="tr-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748B;">You asked for this report on {{ date_label }}. It’s a one-time email; you haven’t been added to a mailing list. Didn’t ask? You can ignore it.</p>
    <p class="tr-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748B;">{{ postal_line }}</p>
    <p class="tr-muted" style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748B;">An estimate from public records and recent MLS sales, not an appraisal.</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
